. The water may be\ndeeper than you think it is. You will be putting yourself in\ndanger and your vehicle may be damaged, leading to costly\nrepairs.\n\nVisit the National Water Prediction Service at\nhttps://water.noaa.gov/wfo/phi for additional water level and\nflood impact information for your local tide gauge.", "response": "Avoid", "note": null, "parameters": {"AWIPSidentifier": ["CFWPHI"], "WMOidentifier": ["WHUS41 KPHI 130804"], "NWSheadline": ["COASTAL FLOOD WARNING IN EFFECT FROM 9 AM THIS MORNING TO 3 PM EST THIS AFTERNOON"], "BLOCKCHANNEL": ["EAS", "NWEM", "CMAS"], "EAS-ORG": ["WXR"], "VTEC": ["/O.NEW.KPHI.CF.W.0003.261113T1400Z-261113T2000Z/"], "eventEndingTime": ["2026-11-13T15:00:00-05:00"]}, "scope": "Public", "code": "IPAWSv1.0", "language": "en-US", "web": "http://www.weather.gov", "eventCode": {"SAME": ["CFW"], "NationalWeatherService": ["CFW"]}, "replacedBy": "https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.d7aedd8d793109ff23a1eeb66de15b021136a222.001.1", "replacedAt": "2026-11-13T14:47:00-05:00"}}, {"id": "https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.0f678f7dc35c8a28f0eeb0efe7c564a4191d10d5.001.1", "type": "Feature", "geometry": null, "properties": {"@id": "https://api.weather.gov/alerts/urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.0f678f7dc35c8a28f0eeb0efe7c564a4191d10d5.001.1", "@type": "wx:Alert", "id": "urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.0f678f7dc35c8a28f0eeb0efe7c564a4191d10d5.001.1", "areaDesc": "Dade; Walker; Catoosa; Whitfield; Murray; Fannin; Gilmer; Union; Towns; Chattooga; Gordon; Pickens; Dawson; Lumpkin; White; Floyd; Bartow; Cherokee; Forsyth; Polk; Paulding; Cobb; Haralson; Carroll; Douglas; Heard; Coweta; Troup; Meriwether; Harris", "geocode": {"SAME": ["013083", "013295", "013047", "013313", "013213", "013111", "013123", "013291", "013281", "013055", "013129", "013227", "013085", "013187", "013311", "013115", "013015", "013057", "013117", "013233", "013223", "013067", "013143", "013045", "013097", "013149", "013077", "013285", "013199", "013145"], 